CyBoT -CYcloidal roBOT - Starting analysis of Axis 4
This week I will analyze how we can design the axis 4. I have added the openCyRe from Damian Lickindorf as a guide but I won't use it, since I d like to design all by myself. This new cyloidal gearbox should be the same for axis 4, 5 and 6 with a minimum of 1:11 ratio and will be drive by a nema17.
Not sure yet if I will add an extra encoder.
In Atlas, the axis 4 use an aluminium tube, which is not really conveniant for a DIY project. I will probably replace it by a printed component, reinforced by metalic part.

